{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56344","headline":"赠琴僧 · 唐枢","name":"赠琴僧","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不待江上移入座，便开（一作「闻」）三峡水来声。\n（《千载佳句》卷下《宴喜部·琴》。\n）（按：《全唐诗逸》卷中录此诗，缺一字，今重录。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐枢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56344.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56344","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}